      "description": "Furbo is the best-in-class solution to take care of your pet when you’re not at home. An interactive pet camera that lets you see, talk, and play with your pets when you’re away. The AI-powered Furbo Nanny gives you ultimate peace of mind.\n\nKeep your furry loved one safe, happy, and healthy even when you’re apart.\n\nThis app requires a Furbo camera.\n\nKeep them safe from harm\n\nAnything can happen when our pets are home alone. Be promptly notified and protect them from emergencies.\n\nNever miss a precious moment\n\nCatch every selfie, zoomie, and candid moment. Save and share all these cherished memories.\n\nMonitor your pet’s daily activity, health, and behavioral patterns\n\nGet peace of mind by tracking daily routines, identifying unusual behavior, and receiving early warnings of potential health concerns.\n\nAlways getting smarter\n\nFurbo Nanny is an always-improving super AI assistant as it learns more about your pet’s patterns and behaviors. Get AI-driven insights tailored just for you and your pet with intelligent features and continuous updates.",
